{"term":{"label":"心","occurrences":1,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"5A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i","title":"萬章上","description":"萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"侯","id":"侯"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"孝","id":"孝"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"慕","id":"慕"},{"form":"歌","id":"歌"},{"form":"母","id":"母"},{"form":"父","id":"父"},{"form":"至","id":"至"},{"form":"莫","id":"莫"},{"form":"親","id":"親"},{"form":"言","id":"言"},{"form":"諸","id":"諸"},{"form":"謳","id":"謳"},{"form":"賢","id":"賢"}],"edges":[{"weight":3.332204510175204,"source":"諸","target":"侯"},{"weight":1.0090001299784226,"source":"諸","target":"子"},{"weight":2.0794415416798357,"source":"諸","target":"大"},{"weight":2.2129729343043585,"source":"至","target":"大"},{"weight":0.7370664144947809,"source":"至","target":"子"},{"weight":2.2129729343043585,"source":"至","target":"孝"},{"weight":2.618438042412523,"source":"至","target":"莫"},{"weight":2.5006550067561393,"source":"至","target":"親"},{"weight":0.766053951368033,"source":"至","target":"父"},{"weight":2.0794415416798357,"source":"莫","target":"大"},{"weight":2.0794415416798357,"source":"莫","target":"孝"},{"weight":2.367123614131617,"source":"莫","target":"親"},{"weight":2.7119641004233466,"source":"母","target":"父"},{"weight":1.6533571463689358,"source":"母","target":"慕"},{"weight":0.8266785731844679,"source":"母","target":"大"},{"weight":1.519825753744413,"source":"母","target":"孝"},{"weight":1.9898293829901488,"source":"心","target":"子"},{"weight":4.1588830833596715,"source":"心","target":"孝"},{"weight":1.4592011319279783,"source":"父","target":"慕"},{"weight":0.6325225587435105,"source":"父","target":"大"},{"weight":1.3256697393034558,"source":"父","target":"孝"},{"weight":0.25522832760204245,"source":"父","target":"子"},{"weight":1.2966822024302034,"s